<channel|>I have read `goal.md` and `contract.md`, and implemented the `resultsArray` function in `solution.py`.

The implementation checks each subarray of size `k` to see if it is sorted in ascending order with consecutive integers (i.e., `subarray[j+1] == subarray[j] + 1`). If it satisfies this condition, it appends the maximum element; otherwise, it appends `-1`.
